roving card quality and smoothing draws in a planeswalker-heavy deck.", "source_urls": [], "source_titles": []}, {"name": "Jace's Triumph", "image_url": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/4/9/4924f177-5ee2-4d3f-9603-4b9aef4dac09.jpg?1783933463", "scryfall_url": "https://scryfall.com/card/war/55/jaces-triumph?utm_source=api", "types": ["Sorcery"], "color_identity": ["U"], "evidence": [], "scores": {"story": 0.0, "synergy": 0.0, "similarity": 0.803, "total": 0.161}, "reason": "Draw two cards normally, but draw three if a Jace planeswalker is controlled; an efficient draw spell that rewards the Jace tribal theme.", "source_urls": [], "source_titles": []}, {"name": "Jace's Sentinel", "image_url": "https://cards.scryfall.io/normal/front/9/1/9131361b-ec1e-4390-82c9-b9b9f77792a8.jpg?1783935684", "scryfall_url": "https://scryfall.com/card/xln/283/jaces-sentinel?utm_source=api", "types": ["Creature"], "color_identity": ["U"], "evidence": [], "scores": {"story": 0.0, "synergy": 0.0, "similarity": 0.683, "total": 0.137}, "reason": "While a Jace planeswalker is controlled, this creature gets +1/+0 and can't be blocked, providing a cheap evasive attacker that benefits from maintaining Jaces on board.", "source_urls": [], "source_titles": []}]}]}

